features/sea-compact/world-task.md:21:- Out of scope: new sailing mechanics (slow zones, currents, wind), ruins, loot, encounters, more islands.
features/world-sea/decisions.md:7:- Scope is slice 2 of the plan: map, sailing, docking and server-enforced visibility, running in parallel with `duel-core`. On-foot island exploration, ruins, loot and encounters come later.
features/world-sea/decisions.md:26:- Walking on islands, ruins and rubbings, loot, rumors, fog secrets and the final island: `objectives-endgame`.
features/world-sea/world-task.md:19:- Out of scope: walking on islands, ruins, rubbings, loot, rumors, encounters, fruit, economy, match phases.
features/ledger-economy/decisions.md:8:- The ledger tracks spent gold as `goldSpent`, so the invariant becomes "balances + spent = issued". Minted gold comes only through keyed grants (ruin once per player per ruin; supply cache once per match), so nothing can be farmed.
